00:56:38.390 --> 00:56:42.210
<v Rebecca>Ghetto hoochie mama.

00:56:42.210 --> 00:56:44.030
<v Ira Glass>Or perhaps you would prefer--

00:56:44.030 --> 00:56:48.140
<v Rebecca>Booty house girl.

00:56:48.140 --> 00:57:06.400
